message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the reference paper below."
title: "Demo: A Declarative Framework to Run, Share, and Reproduce 6G Experiments"
abstract: >-
  5G and 6G systems are increasingly modular and programmable, combining heterogeneous 
  RAN, core, and AI components through standardized interfaces. With the emergence of 
  Integrated Sensing and Communication (ISAC) and 6G AI-RAN, rApps and xApps have been 
  augmented with real-time control loops managed by dApps co-located with the DU to 
  operate at timescales below 10 ms.
